Transition to Mode 3 when $x_1 \ge 28.6$.                                       
- Mode 3 (sharp descent and recovery): $x_1[2] = -1.33 \cdot x_1[1] + 0.74 \cdot
x_1[0] - 38.53$. Transition back to Mode 1 when $x_1 \le 15.0$ (during descent).
                                                                                
The system follows a cyclic structure $1 \to 2 \to 3 \to 1$. I will now provide 
the HA specification based on these findings.                                   
                                                                                
