<code>                                                                          
task_description = """                                                          
Analyze the provided npz data files to identify the Hybrid Automaton model.     
1. Load the data from the three samples.                                        
2. For each sample, compute the first derivative (x1[1]) and second derivative  
(x1[2]) of x1.                                                                  
3. Identify mode transitions by looking for sudden changes (discontinuities) in 
x1[2].                                                                          
4. Group the data into segments based on these transitions.                     
5. For each segment, determine the mode ID and find the governing second-order  
ODE of the form:                                                                
