- **Mode 1 → Mode 2:** Triggered when x1 >= 25.0. Observed at t ≈ 1.50s in the 
provided data.
- **Mode 2 → Mode 3:** Triggered when x1 <= 20.0 (on the descending part of the 
oscillation).
- **Mode 3 → Mode 1:** Triggered when x1 <= 15.0.
- **Continuous States:** No resets (jumps) in x1 or dot{x1} were found at 
transition times.

